#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:17
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.7.rst:276
msgid "Platforms"
msgstr "Platforms"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:21
msgid ""
"See :ref:`doc_system_requirements` for hardware and software version "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"Zie :ref:`doc_system_requirements` voor hardware- en softwareversie eisen."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:25
#: ../../docs/getting_started/introduction/introduction_to_godot.rst:24
msgid ""
"For information about console support, see the `Godot website <https://"
"godotengine.org/consoles/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Voor informatie over ondersteuning voor consoles, bekijk `de console pagina "
"op de Godot website <https://godotengine.org/consoles/>`_."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:27
msgid "**Can run both the editor and exported projects:**"
msgstr "**Kan in de editor en de geëxporteerde projecten draaien:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:29
msgid "Windows (x86 and ARM, 64-bit and 32-bit)."
msgstr "Windows (x86 en ARM, 64-bit en 32-bit)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:30
msgid "macOS (x86 and ARM, 64-bit only)."
msgstr "macOS (x86 en ARM, alleen 64-bit)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:31
msgid "Linux (x86 and ARM, 64-bit and 32-bit)."
msgstr "Linux (x86 en ARM, 64-bit en 32-bit)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:33
msgid ""
"Binaries are statically linked and can run on any distribution if compiled "
"on an old enough base distribution."
msgstr ""
"Binaries zijn statistisch gelinked en kunnen op elke distributie draaien als "
"de base distribution oud genoeg is."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:35
msgid ""
"Official binaries are compiled using the `Godot Engine buildroot <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/buildroot>`__, allowing for binaries that work across "
"common Linux distributions."
msgstr ""
"Officiële binaire bestanden worden gecompileerd door middel van de `Godot "
"Engine buildroot <https://github.com/godotengine/buildroot>`__, wat ervoor "
"zorgt dat de binaire bestanden op alle Linux distributies werken."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:39
msgid "Android (editor support is experimental)."
msgstr "Android (editor ondersteuning is experimenteel)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:40
msgid ""
":ref:`Web browsers <doc_using_the_web_editor>`. Experimental in 4.0, using "
"Godot 3.x is recommended instead when targeting HTML5."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Web browsers <doc_using_the_web_editor>`. Experimenteel in 4.0, Godot "
"3.x wordt aanbevolen als exporteren naar HTML5 het doel is."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:45
msgid ""
"Linux supports rv64 (RISC-V), ppc64 & ppc32 (PowerPC), and loongarch64. "
"However you must compile the editor for that platform (as well as export "
"templates) yourself, no official downloads are currently provided. RISC-V "
"compiling instructions can be found on the :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd` "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Linux ondersteunt rv64 (RISC-V), ppc64 & ppc32 (PowerPC) en loongarch64. "
"Daarvoor moet je de editor (met de exporteersjablonen) wel zelf compileren; "
"hiervoor zijn geen officiële downloads beschikbaar. "
"De :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd` pagina bevat instructies om te "
"compileren voor RISC-V."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:50
msgid "**Runs exported projects:**"
msgstr "**Draait geëxporteerde projecten:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:52
msgid "iOS."
msgstr "iOS."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:54
msgid ""
"Godot aims to be as platform-independent as possible and can be :ref:`ported "
"to new platforms <doc_custom_platform_ports>` with relative ease."
msgstr ""
"Godot richt zich op zo platform-onafhankelijk mogelijk te zijn, en kan vrij "
"gemakkelijk :ref:`worden geport naar nieuwe platforms "
"<doc_custom_platform_ports>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:59
#: ../../docs/getting_started/step_by_step/scripting_languages.rst:129
msgid ""
"Projects written in C# using Godot 4 currently cannot be exported to the web "
"platform. To use C# on that platform, consider Godot 3 instead. Android and "
"iOS platform support is available as of Godot 4.2, but is experimental "
"and :ref:`some limitations apply <doc_c_sharp_platforms>`."
msgstr ""
"Projecten geschreven in C# die gebruik maken van Godot 4 kunnen op dit "
"moment niet worden geëxporteerd via het webplatform. Om C# op dit platform "
"te kunnen gebruiken, kunt u overwegen om Godot 3 te gebruiken. Android en "
"iOS platformondersteuning is beschikbaar vanaf Godot 4.2, maar is "
"experimenteel en :ref:`heeft beperkingen <doc_c_sharp_platforms>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:65
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:22
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:59
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:98
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:311
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:351
#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/external_editor.rst:43
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.rst:127
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.7.rst:161
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/compiling_with_dotnet.rst:204
msgid "Editor"
msgstr "Bewerker"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:67
#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:561
msgid "**Features:**"
msgstr "**Functionaliteiten:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:69
msgid "Scene tree editor."
msgstr "Scène boom editor."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:70
msgid ""
"Built-in script editor. Also supports editing text files and using custom "
"syntax highlighters."
msgstr ""
"Ingebouwde script-editor. Ondersteunt ook het bewerken van tekstbestanden en "
"het gebruik van aangepaste syntaxmarkering."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:72
msgid ""
"Support for :ref:`external script editors <doc_external_editor>` such as "
"Visual Studio Code or Vim."
msgstr ""
"Ondersteuning voor :ref:`externe script editors <doc_external_editor>` zoals "
"Visual Studio Code of Vim."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:74
msgid "GDScript :ref:`debugger <doc_debugger_panel>`."
msgstr "GDScript :ref:`debugger <doc_debugger_panel>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:76
msgid "Supports debugging in threads."
msgstr "Ondersteuning voor debuggen in threads."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:78
msgid ""
"Visual profiler with CPU and GPU time indications for each step of the "
"rendering pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Visuele profiler met CPU en GPU tijdsindicaties voor elke stap van de "
"rendering pipeline."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:80
msgid ""
"Performance monitoring tools, including :ref:`custom performance monitors "
"<doc_custom_performance_monitors>`."
msgstr ""
"Performance monitoring gereedschap, inclusief :ref:`eigen performance "
"monitors <doc_custom_performance_monitors>`."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:82
msgid ""
"Supports :ref:`tracing profilers <doc_tracing_profilers>` "
"like :ref:`doc_profiler_tracy` and :ref:`doc_profiler_perfetto` for deeper "
"optimization tasks."
msgstr ""
"Ondersteunt :ref:`tracing-profilers <doc_tracing_profilers>` "
"zoals :ref:`doc_profiler_tracy` en :ref:`doc_profiler_perfetto` voor "
"complexe optimalisatietaken."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:84
msgid ""
"Any script can be :ref:`run in the editor <doc_running_code_in_the_editor>` "
"and provide custom functionality such as clickable buttons in the inspector, "
"without needing to create an editor plugin."
msgstr ""
"Elk script kan worden :ref:`gedraaid in de editor "
"<doc_running_code_in_the_editor>`, voor aangepaste functies zoals klikbare "
"knoppen in het infopaneel. Daarvoor hoeft geen plug-in voor de editor "
"gemaakt te worden."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:87
msgid "Live script reloading."
msgstr "Live scripts herladen."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:88
msgid "Live scene editing."
msgstr "Live scènes bewerken."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:90
msgid ""
"Changes *will* reflect in the editor and *will* be kept after closing the "
"running project."
msgstr ""
"Veranderingen zijn *wel* zichtbaar in de editor, en worden *wel* behouden na "
"het sluiten van het draaiende project."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:92
msgid "Live camera replication (disabled by default)."
msgstr "Live camerareplicatie (standaard uitgezet)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:94
msgid "Move the in-editor camera and see the result in the running project."
msgstr ""
"Beweeg de camera in de editor en ze het resultaat in het draaiende project."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:96
msgid "Remote inspector."
msgstr "Remote inspector."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:98
msgid ""
"Changes *won't* reflect in the editor and *won't* be kept after closing the "
"running project."
msgstr ""
"Veranderingen zijn *niet* zichtbaar in de editor, en worden *niet* behouden "
"na het sluiten van het draaiende project."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:100
msgid ""
"Run multiple simultaneous project instances from a single editor instance "
"(useful for client/server testing)."
msgstr ""
"Draai meerdere projectinstanties tegelijkertijd vanuit een enkele "
"editorinstantie (handig voor client/server-tests)."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:102
msgid ""
"Optional :ref:`game embedding <doc_game_embedding>` to run the project in a "
"panel within the editor."
msgstr ""
"Optioneel :ref:`game embedding <doc_game_embedding>` om het project in een "
"paneel binnen de editor te draaien."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:104
msgid ""
"Select 2D and 3D nodes in the project's viewport to inspect them in the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer 2D- en 3D-knopen in het beeldvenster van het project om ze te "
"inspecteren in het infopaneel."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:105
msgid ""
"Move the camera within the project using the 2D and 3D camera overrides."
msgstr ""
"Verplaats de camera binnen het project met de 2D- en 3D-camera overname."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:106
msgid "Supports time scale adjustments, pausing, and frame advance."
msgstr "Ondersteunt tijdsschaalaanpassingen, pauzeren, en per frame doorlopen."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:107
msgid "Supports muting the project."
msgstr "Ondersteunt het dempen van het project."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:109
msgid "Ruler tool to measure distances in 2D and 3D."
msgstr "Meetlatgereedschap om afstanden te meten in 2D en 3D."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:110
msgid "Vertex snapping support in 3D."
msgstr "Ondersteuning voor vertex-uitlijnen in 3D."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:111
msgid ""
"Support for following the selection as it moves in 3D by using Focus "
"Selection twice."
msgstr ""
"Ondersteuning voor het volgen van de selectie terwijl deze beweegt in 3D, "
"door twee keer \"Focus op Selectie\" te gebruiken."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:112
msgid "Built-in offline class reference documentation."
msgstr "Ingebouwde offline documentatie voor klassereferentie."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:113
msgid "Use the editor in dozens of languages contributed by the community."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik de editor in de vele beschikbare talen, mogelijk gemaakt door de "
"gemeenschap."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:115
msgid "**Plugins:**"
msgstr "**Plug-ins:**"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:117
msgid ""
"Editor plugins can be downloaded from the :ref:`Asset Store "
"<doc_what_is_asset_store>` to extend editor functionality."
msgstr ""
"Editor-plugins kunnen worden gedownload van de :ref:`Asset-winkel "
"<doc_what_is_asset_store>` om de functionaliteit van de editor uit te "
"breiden."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:119
msgid ""
":ref:`Create your own plugins <doc_making_plugins>` using GDScript to add "
"new features or speed up your workflow."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Maak je eigen plugins <doc_making_plugins>`met GDScript om nieuwe "
"functionaliteiten toe te voegen, of om je werkwijze te versnellen."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:121
msgid ""
":ref:`Download projects from the Asset Store <doc_using_asset_store_editor>` "
"in the Project Manager and import them directly."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Download projecten van de Asset-winkel <doc_using_assetlib_editor>` in "
"de Projectbeheerder en importeer ze direct."

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:125
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:123
#: ../../docs/about/docs_changelog.rst:162
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:120
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.2.rst:128
