msgstr ""
"Zet onder \"Control - Layout/Transform\" de \"Grootte X\" op ``200`` en de "
"\"Grootte Y\" op ``100`` om wat meer afstand tussen de rand en de tekst te "
"houden."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:80
msgid "Choose the \"Anchor Preset\" ``Center Bottom``."
msgstr "Kies de \"Anker Voorinstelling\" ``Midden Onder``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:81
msgid "Under \"Control - Layout/Transform\", set \"Position Y\" to ``580``."
msgstr "Zet onder \"Control - Layout/Transform\" de \"Position Y\" op ``580``."

#: ../../docs/getting_started/first_2d_game/06.heads_up_display.rst:83
msgid ""
"On the ``MessageTimer``, set the ``Wait Time`` to ``2`` and set the ``One "
"Shot`` property to \"On\"."
msgstr ""
"Stel voor de ``MessageTimer`` de ``Wachttijd`` in op ``2`` en zet de "
"eigenschap ``Eénmalig`` op \"Aan\"."

