"threads/thread_model>` voor meer details."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:99
msgid "``--remote-fs <address>``"
msgstr "``--remote-fs <adres>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:99
msgid "|release| Remote filesystem (``<host/IP>[:<port>]`` address)."
msgstr "|release| Bestandssysteem op afstand (``<host/IP>[:<port>]`` adres)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:101
msgid "``--remote-fs-password <password>``"
msgstr "``--remote-fs-password <password>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:101
msgid "|release| Password for remote filesystem."
msgstr "|release| Wachtwoord voor bestandssysteem op afstand."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:103
msgid "``--audio-driver <driver>``"
msgstr "``--audio-driver <driver>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:103
msgid ""
"|release| Audio driver. Use ``--help`` first to display the list of "
"available drivers."
msgstr ""
"|release| Audiostuurprogramma. Gebruik eerst ``--help`` om de lijst van "
"beschikbare stuurprogramma's te zien."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:105
msgid "``--display-driver <driver>``"
msgstr "``--display-driver <driver>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:105
msgid ""
"|release| Display driver (and rendering driver). Use ``--help`` first to "
"display the list of available drivers."
msgstr ""
"|release| Stuurprogramma voor weergave (en renderen). Gebruik eerst ``--"
"help`` om de lijst van beschikbare stuurprogramma's te zien."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:107
msgid "``--audio-output-latency <ms>``"
msgstr "``--audio-output-latency <ms>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:107
msgid ""
"|release| Override audio output latency in milliseconds (default is 15 ms). "
"Lower values make sound playback more reactive but increase CPU usage, and "
"may result in audio cracking if the CPU can't keep up."
msgstr ""
"|release| Overschrijf audio-uitvoervertraging in milliseconden (standaard is "
"15 ms). Lagere waarden kunnen de geluidservaring reactiever maken, maar "
"verhogen het CPU-gebruik; hierdoor kan de audio haperen als de CPU het niet "
"kan bijhouden."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:110
msgid "``--rendering-method <renderer>``"
msgstr "``--rendering-method <renderer>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:110
msgid ""
"|release| Renderer name. Valid values are ``forward_plus``, ``mobile``, and "
"``gl_compatibility``. Requires driver support."
msgstr ""
"|release| Naam van de renderer. Valide waarden zijn ``forward_plus``, "
"``mobile`` en ``gl_compatibility``. Vereist ondersteuning van het "
"stuurprogramma."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:112
msgid "``--rendering-driver <driver>``"
msgstr "``--rendering-driver <driver>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:112
msgid ""
"|release| Rendering driver (depends on display driver). Use ``--help`` first "
"to display the list of available drivers."
msgstr ""
"|release| Stuurprogramma voor renderen (hangt af van het stuurprogramma voor "
"weergave). Gebruik eerst ``--help`` om de lijst van beschikbare "
"stuurprogramma's te zien."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:114
msgid "``--gpu-index <device_index>``"
msgstr "``--gpu-index <apparaat_index>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:114
msgid ""
"|release| Use a specific GPU (only available on the Forward+/Mobile "
"renderers; run with ``--verbose`` to get available device list)."
msgstr ""
"|release| Gebruik een specifieke GPU (alleen beschikbaar met de Forward+-/"
"Mobile-renderers; draai met ``--verbose`` om de lijst van beschikbare "
"apparaten te zien)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:116
msgid "``--text-driver <driver>``"
msgstr "``--text-driver <driver>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:116
msgid "|release| Text driver (Fonts, BiDi, shaping)."
msgstr "|release| Stuurprogramma voor tekst (Lettertypes, BiDi, shaping)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:118
msgid "``--tablet-driver <driver>``"
msgstr "``--tablet-driver <driver>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:118
msgid "|release| Pen tablet input driver."
msgstr "|release| Stuurprogramma voor tekentabletinvoer."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:120
msgid "``--headless``"
msgstr "``--headless``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:120
msgid ""
"|release| Enable headless mode (``--display-driver headless --audio-driver "
"Dummy``). Useful for servers and with ``--script``."
msgstr ""
"|release| Headless-modus gebruiken (``--display-driver headless --audio-"
"driver Dummy``). Nuttig voor servers en met ``--script``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:122
msgid "``--log-file``"
msgstr "``--log-file``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:122
msgid ""
"|release| Write output/error log to the specified path instead of the "
"default location defined by the project. ``<file>`` path should be absolute "
"or relative to the project directory."
msgstr ""
"|release| Schrijf uitvoer-/errorlog naar het aangegeven pad in plaats van "
"naar de standaardlocatie die wordt gedefinieerd in het project. ``<file>``-"
"pad moet absoluut of relatief aan de projectmap zijn."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:125
msgid "``--write-movie <file>``"
msgstr "``--write-movie <file>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:125
msgid ""
"|release| Run the engine in a way that a movie is written (usually with .avi "
"or .png extension). ``--fixed-fps`` is forced when enabled, but can be used "
"to change movie FPS. ``--disable-vsync`` can speed up movie writing but "
"makes interaction more difficult. ``--quit-after`` can be used to specify "
"the number of frames to write."
msgstr ""
"|release| Draai de engine op zo'n manier dat er een film wordt geschreven "
"(meestal met .avi- of .png-extensie). ``--fixed-fps`` wordt geforceerd "
"indien gebruikt, maar kan worden gebruikt om de FPS van de film te "
"veranderen. ``--disable-vsync`` kan het schrijven sneller maken, maar maakt "
"interactie lastiger. ``--quit-after`` kan worden gebruikt om het aantal "
"frames te specificeren dat moet worden geschreven."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:131
msgid "**Display options**"
msgstr "**Weergaveopties**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:136
msgid "``-f``, ``--fullscreen``"
msgstr "``-f``, ``--fullscreen``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:136
msgid "|release| Request fullscreen mode."
msgstr "|release| Gebruik volledig-schermmodus."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:138
msgid "``-m``, ``--maximized``"
msgstr "``-m``, ``--maximized``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:138
msgid "|release| Request a maximized window."
msgstr "|release| Gebruik gemaximaliseerd venster."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:140
msgid "``-w``, ``--windowed``"
msgstr "``-w``, ``--windowed``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:140
msgid "|release| Request windowed mode."
msgstr "|release| Gebruik venstermodus."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:142
msgid "``-t``, ``--always-on-top``"
msgstr "``-t``, ``--always-on-top``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:142
msgid "|release| Request an always-on-top window."
msgstr "|release| Gebruik een venster dat altijd op de voorgrond blijft."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:144
msgid "``--resolution <W>x<H>``"
msgstr "``--resolution <W>x<H>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:144
msgid "|release| Request window resolution."
msgstr "|release| Geef vensterresolutie aan."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:146
msgid "``--position <X>,<Y>``"
msgstr "``--position <X>,<Y>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:146
msgid "|release| Request window position."
msgstr "|release| Geef vensterpositie aan."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:148
msgid "``--screen <N>``"
msgstr "``--screen <N>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:148
msgid "|release| Request window screen."
msgstr "|release| Selecteer beeldscherm voor venster."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:150
msgid "``--single-window``"
msgstr "``--single-window``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:150
msgid "|release| Use a single window (no separate subwindows)."
msgstr "|release| Gebruik een enkel venster (geen aparte subvensters)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:152
msgid "``--xr-mode <mode>``"
msgstr "``--xr-mode <modus>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:152
msgid "|release| Select XR mode (\"default\", \"off\", \"on\")."
msgstr ""
"|release| Selecteer XR-modus (\"default\" (standaard), \"off\" (uit), \"on\" "
"(aan))."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:154
msgid "``--wid <window_id>``"
msgstr "``--wid <window_id>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:154
msgid "|release| Request parented to window."
msgstr "|release| Geef oudervenster aan."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:156
msgid "``--accessibility <mode>``"
msgstr "``--accessibility <modus>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:156
msgid ""
"|release| Select accessibility mode [\"auto\" (when screen reader is "
"running, default), \"always\", \"disabled\"]."
msgstr ""
"|release| Selecteer toegankelijkheidsmodus [\"auto\" (wanneer schermlezer "
"draait, standaard), \"always\" (altijd), \"disabled\" (uit)]."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:160
msgid "**Debug options**"
msgstr "**Foutopsporingsopties**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:165
msgid "``-d``, ``--debug``"
msgstr "``-d``, ``--debug``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:165
msgid "|release| Debug (local stdout debugger)."
msgstr "|release| Foutopsporing (lokale stdout-foutopspoorder)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:167
msgid "``-b``, ``--breakpoints``"
msgstr "``-b``, ``--breakpoints``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:167
msgid ""
"|release| Breakpoint list as source::line comma-separated pairs, no spaces "
"(use ``%20`` instead)."
msgstr ""
"|release| Lijst van breekpunten als kommagescheiden paren bron::regel, "
"zonder spaties (gebruik in plaats daarvan ``%20``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:169
msgid "``--ignore-error-breaks``"
msgstr "``--ignore-error-breaks``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:169
msgid "|release| If debugger is connected, prevents sending error breakpoints."
msgstr ""
"|release| Als de foutopspoorder is verbonden, blokkeert dit breekpunten voor "
"foutmeldingen."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:171
msgid "``--profiling``"
msgstr "``--profiling``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:171
msgid "|release| Enable profiling in the script debugger."
msgstr "|release| Gebruik profilering in de scriptfoutopspoorder."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:173
msgid "``--gpu-profile``"
msgstr "``--gpu-profile``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:173
msgid ""
"|release| Show a GPU profile of the tasks that took the most time during "
"frame rendering."
msgstr ""
"|release| Toon een GPU-profiel van de taken die het meeste tijd kostten "
"tijdens het renderen van frames."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:175
msgid "``--gpu-validation``"
msgstr "``--gpu-validation``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:175
msgid ""
"|release| Enable graphics API :ref:`validation layers "
"<doc_vulkan_validation_layers>` for debugging."
msgstr ""
"|release| Gebruik :ref:`validatielagen <doc_vulkan_validation_layers>` van "
"de Graphics-API voor foutopsporing."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:177
msgid "``--gpu-abort``"
msgstr "``--gpu-abort``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:177
msgid ""
"|debug| Abort on GPU errors (usually validation layer errors), may help see "
"the problem if your system freezes."
msgstr ""
"|debug| Breek af bij GPU-foutmeldingen (meestal foutmeldingen van "
"validatielagen). Kan helpen om het probleem te zien als je systeem bevriest."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:179
msgid "``--generate-spirv-debug-info``"
msgstr "``--generate-spirv-debug-info``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:179
msgid ""
"|debug| Generate SPIR-V debug information. This allows source-level shader "
"debugging with RenderDoc."
msgstr ""
"|debug| Genereer SPIR-V-foutopsporingsinformatie. Dit maakt foutopsporing op "
"bronniveau voor shaders mogelijk met RenderDoc."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:181
msgid "``--extra-gpu-memory-tracking``"
msgstr "``--extra-gpu-memory-tracking``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:181
msgid ""
"|debug| Enables additional memory tracking "
"(see :ref:`RenderingDevice.get_driver_and_device_memory_report() "
"<class_RenderingDevice_method_get_driver_and_device_memory_report>` and "
"linked methods). Currently only implemented for Vulkan. Enabling this "
"feature may cause crashes on some systems due to buggy drivers or bugs in "
"the Vulkan Loader. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95967"
msgstr ""
"|debug| Schakelt extra geheugentracering in "
"(zie :ref:`RenderingDevice.get_driver_and_device_memory_report() "
"<class_RenderingDevice_method_get_driver_and_device_memory_report>` en "
"gelinkte methoden). Momenteel alleen geïmplementeerd voor Vulkan. Het "
"inschakelen van deze functionaliteit kan op sommige systemen zorgen voor "
"crashes, vanwege fouten in stuurprogramma's of in de Vulkan Loader. Zie "
"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95967"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:187
msgid "``--accurate-breadcrumbs``"
msgstr "``--accurate-breadcrumbs``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:187
msgid ""
"|debug| Force barriers between breadcrumbs. Useful for narrowing down a "
"command causing GPU resets. Currently only implemented for Vulkan."
msgstr ""
"|debug| Forceert barrières tussen breadcrumbs. Handig om te elimineren welke "
"opdracht GPU-resets veroorzaakt. Momenteel alleen geïmplementeerd voor "
"Vulkan."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:190
msgid "``--remote-debug <uri>``"
msgstr "``--remote-debug <uri>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:190
msgid ""
"|release| Remote debug (``<protocol>://<host/IP>[:<port>]``, e.g. ``tcp://"
"127.0.0.1:6007``)."
msgstr ""
"|release| Foutopsporing op afstand (``<protocol>://<host/IP>[:<port>]``, "
"bijv. ``tcp://127.0.0.1:6007``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:192
msgid "``--single-threaded-scene``"
msgstr "``--single-threaded-scene``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:192
msgid ""
"|release| Scene tree runs in single-threaded mode. Sub-thread groups are "
"disabled and run on the main thread."
msgstr ""
"|release| Scèneboom draait in single-threadmodus. Groepen van sub-threads "
"zijn uitgeschakeld en draaien op de hoofdthread."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:194
msgid "``--debug-collisions``"
msgstr "``--debug-collisions``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:194
msgid "|debug| Show collision shapes when running the scene."
msgstr "|debug| Toon botsingsvormen bij het draaien van de scène."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:196
msgid "``--debug-paths``"
msgstr "``--debug-paths``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:196
msgid "|debug| Show path lines when running the scene."
msgstr "|debug| Teken padlijnen bij het draaien van de scène."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:198
msgid "``--debug-navigation``"
msgstr "``--debug-navigation``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:198
msgid "|debug| Show navigation polygons when running the scene."
msgstr "|debug| Teken navigatiepolygonen bij het draaien van de scène."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:200
msgid "``--debug-avoidance``"
msgstr "``--debug-avoidance``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:200
msgid "|debug| Show navigation avoidance debug visuals when running the scene."
msgstr ""
"|debug| Toon visuele weergave voor foutopsporing van navigatievermijding bij "
"het draaien van de scène."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:202
msgid "``--debug-stringnames``"
msgstr "``--debug-stringnames``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:202
msgid ""
"|debug| Print all StringName allocations to stdout when the engine quits."
msgstr ""
"|debug| Print alle StringName-toewijzingen naar stdout als de engine afsluit."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:204
msgid "``--debug-canvas-item-redraw``"
msgstr "``--debug-canvas-item-redraw``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:204
msgid ""
"|debug| Display a rectangle each time a canvas item requests a redraw "
"(useful to troubleshoot low processor mode)."
msgstr ""
"|debug| Teken een rechthoek iedere keer dan een canvas item een hertekening "
"aanvraagt (nuttig om problemen met lage processormodus op te sporen)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:207
msgid "``--max-fps <fps>``"
msgstr "``--max-fps <fps>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:207
msgid ""
"|release| Set a maximum number of frames per second rendered (can be used to "
"limit power usage). A value of 0 results in unlimited framerate."
msgstr ""
"|release| Stel een maximaal aantal frames in dat wordt gerenderd per seconde "
"(kan worden gebruikt om energieverbruik te beperken). Een waarde van 0 "
"betekent onbegrensde framesnelheid."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:210
msgid "``--frame-delay <ms>``"
msgstr "``--frame-delay <ms>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:210
msgid ""
"|release| Simulate high CPU load (delay each frame by <ms> milliseconds). Do "
"not use as a FPS limiter; use ``--max-fps`` instead."
msgstr ""
"|release| Simuleer hoge CPU-lading (vertraag elk frame met <ms> "
"milliseconden). Gebruik dit niet om FPS te beperken; gebruik in plaats "
"daarvan ``--max-fps``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:213
msgid "``--time-scale <scale>``"
msgstr "``--time-scale <scale>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:213
msgid ""
"|release| Force time scale (higher values are faster, 1.0 is normal speed)."
msgstr ""
"|release| Forceer tijdsschaal (hogere waarden zijn sneller, 1,0 is normale "
"snelheid)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:215
msgid "``--disable-vsync``"
msgstr "``--disable-vsync``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:215
msgid ""
"|release| Forces disabling of vertical synchronization, even if enabled in "
"the project settings. Does not override driver-level V-Sync enforcement."
msgstr ""
"|release| Forceert uitschakeling van verticale synchronisatie, ook als dit "
"is ingeschakeld in de projectinstellingen. Overschrijft geen forcering van V-"
"sync in het stuurprogramma."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:218
msgid "``--disable-render-loop``"
msgstr "``--disable-render-loop``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:218
msgid ""
"|release| Disable render loop so rendering only occurs when called "
"explicitly from script."
msgstr ""
"|release| Schakel renderlus uit, zodat renderen alleen gebeurt als het "
"expliciet wordt aangeroepen vanuit het script."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:220
msgid "``--disable-crash-handler``"
msgstr "``--disable-crash-handler``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:220
msgid "|release| Disable crash handler when supported by the platform code."
msgstr ""
"|release| Schakel crash-handler uit als dit wordt ondersteund door de "
"platformcode."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:222
msgid "``--fixed-fps <fps>``"
msgstr "``--fixed-fps <fps>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:222
msgid ""
"|release| Force a fixed number of frames per second. This setting disables "
"real-time synchronization."
msgstr ""
"|release| Forceer een vast aantal frames per seconde. Deze instelling "
"schakelt real-timesynchronisatie uit."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:224
msgid "``--delta-smoothing <enable>``"
msgstr "``--delta-smoothing <enable>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:224
msgid ""
"|release| Enable or disable frame delta smoothing (\"enable\", \"disable\")."
msgstr ""
"|release| Schakel delta-afvlakking aan of uit (\"enable\" (aan), \"disable\" "
"(uit))."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:226
msgid "``--print-fps``"
msgstr "``--print-fps``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:226
msgid "|release| Print the frames per second to the stdout."
msgstr "|release| Print het aantal frames per seconden naar stdout."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:228
msgid "``--editor-pseudolocalization``"
msgstr "``--editor-pseudolocalization``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:228
msgid ""
"|editor| Enable pseudolocalization for the editor and the project manager."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Gebruik pseudolokalisatie voor de editor en de projectbeheerder."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:231
msgid "**Standalone tools**"
msgstr "**Los te gebruiken gereedschap**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:236
msgid "``-s``, ``--script <script>``"
msgstr "``-s``, ``--script <script>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:236
msgid ""
"|extended| Run a script. ``<script>`` must be a resource path relative to "
"the project (``myscript.gd`` will be interpreted as ``res://my_script.gd``) "
"or an absolute filesystem path (for example, on Windows: ``C:/tmp/"
"my_script.gd``)."
msgstr ""
"|extended| Draai een script. ``<script>`` moet een bronpad zijn, relatief "
"aan het project (``myscript.gd`` wordt geïnterpreteerd als ``res://"
"my_script.gd``) of een absolute pad in het bestandssysteem (bijvoorbeeld, op "
"Windows: ``C:/tmp/my_script.gd``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:239
msgid "``--main-loop <main_loop_name>``"
msgstr "``--main-loop <main_loop_naam>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:239
msgid "|extended| Run a MainLoop specified by its global class name."
msgstr "|extended| Draai een MainLoop, aangegeven door de globale klassenaam."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:241
msgid "``--check-only``"
msgstr "``--check-only``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:241
msgid "|extended| Only parse for errors and quit (use with ``--script``)."
msgstr ""
"|extended| Parseer alleen voor foutmeldingen en sluit af (gebruik alleen ``--"
"script``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:243
msgid "``--import``"
msgstr "``--import``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:243
msgid ""
"|editor| Starts the editor, waits for any resources to be imported, and then "
"quits. Implies ``--editor`` and ``--quit``."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Start de editor op, wacht totdat bronnen zijn geïmporteerd, en "
"sluit dan weer af. Impliceert ``--editor`` en ``--quit``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:245
msgid "``--export-release <preset> <path>``"
msgstr "``--export-release <preset> <pad>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:245
msgid ""
"|editor| Export the project in release mode using the given preset and "
"output path. The preset name should match one defined in "
"\"export_presets.cfg\". ``<path>`` should be absolute or relative to the "
"project directory, and include the filename for the binary (e.g. \"builds/"
"game.exe\"). The target directory must exist."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Exporteer het project in releasemodus met de gegeven voorinstelling "
"en uitvoerpad. De naam van de voorinstelling moet overeenkomen met een die "
"is gedefinieerd in \"export_presets.cfg\". ``<pad>`` moet absoluut of "
"relatief aan de projectmap zijn, en inclusief de naam van het binaire "
"bestand (bijv. \"builds/game.exe\"). De doelmap moet bestaan."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:249
msgid "``--export-debug <preset> <path>``"
msgstr "``--export-debug <preset> <pad>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:249
msgid ""
"|editor| Like ``--export-release``, but use debug template. Implies ``--"
"import``."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Net als ``--export-release``, maar gebruikt debugsjabloon. "
"Impliceert ``--import``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:251
msgid "``--export-pack <preset> <path>``"
msgstr "``--export-pack <preset> <pad>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:251
msgid ""
"|editor| Like ``--export-release``, but only export the game pack for the "
"given preset. The ``<path>`` extension determines whether it will be in PCK "
"or ZIP format. Implies ``--import``."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Net als ``--export-release``, maar exporteert alleen het gamepack "
"voor de gegeven preset. De extensie van ``<pad>`` bepaalt of het in PCK- of "
"ZIP-formaat is. Impliceert ``--import``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:254
msgid "``--export-patch <preset> <path>``"
msgstr "``--export-patch <preset> <pad>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:254
msgid ""
"|editor| Export pack with changed files only. See ``--export-pack`` "
"description for other considerations."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Exporteer pack alleen met gewijzigde bestanden. Zie beschrijving "
"``--export-pack`` voor andere overwegingen."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:256
msgid "``--patches <paths>``"
msgstr "``--patches <paden>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:256
msgid ""
"|editor| List of patches to use with ``--export-patch``. The list is comma-"
"separated."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Lijst van patches om te gebruiken met ``--export-patch``. De lijst "
"is kommagescheiden."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:258
msgid "``--install-android-build-template``"
msgstr "``--install-android-build-template``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:258
msgid ""
"|editor| Install the Android build template. Used in conjunction with ``--"
"export-release`` or ``--export-debug``."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Installeer het buildsjabloon voor Android. Gebruikt in combinatie "
"met ``--export-release`` of ``--export-debug``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:260
msgid "``--convert-3to4 [<max_file_kb>] [<max_line_size>]``"
msgstr "``--convert-3to4 [<max_bestand_kb>] [<max_regel_grootte>]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:260
msgid "|editor| Convert project from Godot 3.x to Godot 4.x."
msgstr "|editor| Converteer project van Godot 3.x naar Godot 4.x."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:262
msgid "``--validate-conversion-3to4 [<max_file_kb>] [<max_line_size>]``"
msgstr ""
"``--validate-conversion-3to4 [<max_bestand_kb>] [<max_regel_grootte>]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:262
msgid ""
"|editor| Show what elements will be renamed when converting project from "
"Godot 3.x to Godot 4.x."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Toon welke elementen zullen worden hernoemd bij het converteren van "
"het project van Godot 3.x naar 4.x."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:264
msgid "``--doctool [<path>]``"
msgstr "``--doctool [<pad>]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:264
msgid ""
"|editor| Dump the engine API reference to the given ``<path>`` in XML "
"format, merging if existing files are found."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Schrijf de API-referentie van de engine naar het gegeven ``<pad>`` "
"in XML-formaat; voeg samen als er bestaande bestanden worden aangetroffen."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:266
msgid "``--no-docbase``"
msgstr "``--no-docbase``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:266
msgid "|editor| Disallow dumping the base types (used with ``--doctool``)."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Schrijven van basistypes niet toestaan (gebruikt met ``--doctool``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:268
msgid "``--gdextension-docs``"
msgstr "``--gdextension-docs``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:268
msgid ""
"|editor| Rather than dumping the engine API, generate API reference from all "
"the GDExtensions loaded in the current project (used with ``--doctool``)."
msgstr ""
"|editor| In plaats van de API van de engine te schrijven, genereert dit de "
"API-referentie uit alle GDExtensions die zijn ingeladen in het huidige "
"project (gebruikt met ``--doctool``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:271
msgid "``--gdscript-docs <path>``"
msgstr "``--gdscript-docs <pad>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:271
msgid ""
"|editor| Rather than dumping the engine API, generate API reference from the "
"inline documentation in the GDScript files found in ``<path>`` (used with "
"``--doctool``)."
msgstr ""
"|editor| In plaats van de API van de engine te schrijven, genereert dit de "
"API-referentie uit alle documentatie binnen de code in de GDScript-bestanden "
"die worden gevonden in ``<pad>`` (gebruikt met ``--doctool``)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:274
msgid "``--build-solutions``"
msgstr "``--build-solutions``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:274
msgid ""
"|editor| Build the scripting solutions (e.g. for C# projects). Implies ``--"
"editor`` and requires a valid project to edit."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Bouw de script-solutions (bijv. voor C#-projecten). Impliceert ``-"
"editor`` en heeft een valide project nodig om te bewerkern."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:276
msgid "``--dump-gdextension-interface``"
msgstr "``--dump-gdextension-interface``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:276
msgid ""
"|editor| Generate GDExtension header file \"gdextension_interface.h\" in the "
"current folder. This file is the base file required to implement a "
"GDExtension."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Genereer GDExtension-headerbestand \"gdextension_interface.h\" in "
"de huidige map. Dit bestand is het basisbestand dat nodig is om een "
"GDExtension te implementeren."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:279
msgid "``--dump-gdextension-interface-json``"
msgstr "``--dump-gdextension-interface-json``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:279
msgid ""
"|editor| Generate a JSON dump of the GDExtension interface named "
"\"gdextension_interface.json\" in the current folder."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Genereer een JSON-dump van de GDExtension-interface genaamd "
"\"gdextension_interface.json\" in de huidige map."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:281
msgid "``--dump-extension-api``"
msgstr "``--dump-extension-api``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:281
msgid ""
"|editor| Generate JSON dump of the Godot API for GDExtension bindings named "
"\"extension_api.json\" in the current folder."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Genereer JSON-dump van de Godot-API voor GDExtension-koppelingen "
"genaamd \"extension_api.json\" in de huidige map."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:283
msgid "``--dump-extension-api-with-docs``"
msgstr "``--dump-extension-api-with-docs``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:283
msgid ""
"|editor| Generate JSON dump of the Godot API like the previous option, but "
"including documentation."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Genereer JSON-dump van de Godot-API net als bij de vorige optie, "
"maar mét documentatie."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:285
msgid "``--validate-extension-api <path>``"
msgstr "``--validate-extension-api <pad>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:285
msgid ""
"|editor| Validate an extension API file dumped (with the option above) from "
"a previous version of the engine to ensure API compatibility. If "
"incompatibilities or errors are detected, the return code will be non-zero."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Valideer een extensie-API-bestand dat is geschreven (met de optie "
"hierboven) met een eerdere versie van de Engine om API-compatibiliteit te "
"verzekeren. Als er geen incompatibiliteiten of fouten worden gedetecteerd, "
"is de code die wordt teruggegeven ongelijk aan nul."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:288
msgid "``--benchmark``"
msgstr "``--benchmark``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:288
msgid "|editor| Benchmark the runtime and print it to console."
msgstr "|editor| Benchmark de runtime en print het naar de console."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:290
msgid "``--benchmark-file <path>``"
msgstr "``--benchmark-file <pad>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:290
msgid ""
"|editor| Benchmark the runtime and save it to the given file path, in JSON "
"format. ``<path>`` should be absolute."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Benchmark de runtime en sla het op naar het gegeven bestandspad, in "
"JSON-formaat. ``<pad>`` moet absoluut zijn."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:292
msgid "``--test [--help]``"
msgstr "``--test [--help]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:292
msgid ""
"|editor| Run :ref:`unit tests <doc_unit_testing>` (requires compiling the "
"engine with ``tests=yes``). Use ``--test --help`` for more information."
msgstr ""
"|editor| Draai :ref:`unit tests <doc_unit_testing>` (hiervoor is het nodig "
"de engine te compileren met ``tests=yes``). Gebruik ``--test --help`` voor "
"meer informatie."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:297
msgid "Path"
msgstr "Pad"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:299
msgid ""
"It is recommended to place your Godot editor binary in your ``PATH`` "
"environment variable, so it can be executed easily from any place by typing "
"``godot``. You can do so on Linux by placing the Godot binary in ``/usr/"
"local/bin`` and making sure it is called ``godot`` (case-sensitive)."
msgstr ""
"Het is aangeraden om het binaire bestand van de Godot-editor in je ``PATH``-"
"omgevingsvariabele te zetten, zodat het makkelijk vanuit overal uitgevoerd "
"kan worden door ``godot`` te typen. Op Linux kun je dit doen door het "
"binaire bestand in ``/usr/local/bin`` te plaatsen en het ``godot`` te noemen "
"(hoofdlettergevoelig)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:304
msgid ""
"To achieve this on Windows or macOS easily, you can install Godot using "
"`Scoop <https://scoop.sh>`__ (on Windows) or `Homebrew <https://brew.sh>`__ "
"(on macOS). This will automatically make the copy of Godot installed "
"available in the ``PATH``:"
msgstr ""
"Om dit makkelijk op Windows of macOS te doen, kun je Godot installeren met "
"`Scoop <https://scoop.sh>`__ (op Windows) of `Homebrew <https://brew.sh>`__ "
"(op macOS). Hiermee wordt de kopie van Godot die is geïnstalleerd, "
"automatisch beschikbaar in het ``PATH``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:331
msgid "Setting the project path"
msgstr "Het projectpad instellen"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:333
msgid ""
"Depending on where your Godot binary is located and what your current "
"working directory is, you may need to set the path to your project for any "
"of the following commands to work correctly."
msgstr ""
"Afhankelijk van waar je binaire Godot-bestand staat en waar je huidige map "
"is, moet je misschien nog het pad naar je project instellen om de volgende "
"opdrachten correct te laten werken."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:337
msgid ""
"When running the editor, this can be done by giving the path to the "
"``project.godot`` file of your project as either the first argument, like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"Als je de editor draait, kan dit door het pad mee te geven naar het "
"``project.godot``-bestand van je project . Dit kan als het eerste argument, "
"zoals hieronder:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:344
msgid "For all commands, this can be done by using the ``--path`` argument:"
msgstr "Verder kan dit voor alle opdrachten met het argument ``--path``:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:350
msgid ""
"For example, the full command for exporting your game (as explained below) "
"might look like this:"
msgstr ""
"Bijvoorbeeld, de volledige opdracht om je game te exporteren (zoals "
"hieronder uitgelegd) zou er zo uit kunnen zien:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:356
msgid ""
"When starting from a subdirectory of your project, use the ``--upwards`` "
"argument for Godot to automatically find the ``project.godot`` file by "
"recursively searching the parent directories."
msgstr ""
"Als je opstart vanuit een submap van je project, kun je het argument ``--"
"upwards`` gebruiken. Hiermee zoekt Godot automatisch naar het "
"``project.godot``-bestand door recursief door de bovenliggende mappen te "
"zoeken."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:359
msgid ""
"For example, running a scene (as explained below) nested in a subdirectory "
"might look like this when your working directory is in the same path:"
msgstr ""
"Bijvoorbeeld, het draaien van een scène (zoals hieronder uitgelegd) binnen "
"een submap zou er zou uit kunnen zien, als je de opdracht uitvoert vanuit "
"hetzelfde pad:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:370
msgid "Creating a project"
msgstr "Een project aanmaken"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:373
msgid ""
"Creating a project from the command line can be done by navigating the shell "
"to the desired place and making a ``project.godot`` file."
msgstr ""
"Je kunt een project aanmaken vanuit de opdrachtprompt door eerst de shell "
"naar de gewenste locatie te navigeren, en dan een ``project.godot``-bestand "
"te maken."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:384
msgid "The project can now be opened with Godot."
msgstr "Het project kan nu worden geopend met Godot."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:388
msgid "Running the editor"
msgstr "De Editor starten"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:390
msgid ""
"Running the editor is done by executing Godot with the ``-e`` flag. This "
"must be done from within the project directory or by setting the project "
"path as explained above, otherwise the command is ignored and the Project "
"Manager appears."
msgstr ""
"Je kunt de editor starten door Godot uit te voeren met de flag ``-e``. Dit "
"moet worden gedaan vanuit de projectmap, of door het projectpad in te "
"stellen zoals hierboven uitgelegd, anders wordt de opdracht genegeerd en "
"verschijnt de projectbeheerder."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:398
msgid ""
"When passing in the full path to the ``project.godot`` file, the ``-e`` flag "
"may be omitted."
msgstr ""
"Als je het volledige pad naar het ``project.godot``-bestand doorgeeft, kan "
"de ``-e``-flag worden weggelaten."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:400
msgid ""
"If a scene has been created and saved, it can be edited later by running the "
"same code with that scene as argument."
msgstr ""
"Als een scène is aangemaakt en opgeslagen, kan deze later worden gewerkt "
"door dezelfde code te draaien met die scène als argument."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:408
msgid "Erasing a scene"
msgstr "Een scène wissen"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:410
msgid ""
"Godot is friends with your filesystem and will not create extra metadata "
"files. Use ``rm`` to erase a scene file. Make sure nothing references that "
"scene. Otherwise, an error will be thrown upon opening the project."
msgstr ""
"Godot gaat vriendelijk om met je bestandssysteem en maakt geen extra "
"metadatabestanden. Gebruik ``rm`` om een scènebestand te wissen. Controleer "
"wel of er nergens naar de scène gerefereerd wordt. Anders wordt er een "
"foutmelding opgeworpen bij het openen van het project."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:419
msgid "Running the game"
msgstr "De game starten"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:421
msgid ""
"To run the game, execute Godot within the project directory or with the "
"project path as explained above."
msgstr ""
"Om de game te draaien, kun je Godot uitvoeren binnen de projectmap of met "
"het projectpad, zoals hierboven uitgelegd."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:427
msgid ""
"Note that passing in the ``project.godot`` file will always run the editor "
"instead of running the game."
msgstr ""
"Let erop dat het meegeven van het ``project.godot``-bestand altijd betekent "
"dat de editor wordt opgestart, niet de game."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:429
msgid ""
"When a specific scene needs to be tested, pass that scene to the command "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Als een specifieke scène moet worden getest, kun je die scène meegeven in de "
"opdrachtregel."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:436
#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:185
#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/customizing_html5_shell.rst:216
#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:137
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/index.rst:4
msgid "Debugging"
msgstr "Foutopsporing"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:438
msgid ""
"Catching errors in the command line can be a difficult task because they "
"scroll quickly. For this, a command line debugger is provided by adding ``-"
"d``. It works for running either the game or a single scene."
msgstr ""
"Het kan moeilijk zijn om foutmeldingen te zien via de opdrachtprompt omdat "
"ze snel voorbij scrollen. Daarom wordt er een foutopspoorder voor de "
"opdrachtprompt aangeboden; voeg hiervoor ``-d`` toe. Dit werkt voor het "
"draaien van ofwel de game, ofwel een enkele scène."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:455
msgid ""
"Exporting the project from the command line is also supported. This is "
"especially useful for continuous integration setups."
msgstr ""
"Er is ook ondersteuning voor het exporteren van projecten via de "
"opdrachtprompt. Dit is vooral handig voor een \"continuous integration\"-"
"opzet."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:460
msgid ""
"Using the ``--headless`` command line argument is **required** on platforms "
"that do not have GPU access (such as continuous integration). On platforms "
"with GPU access, ``--headless`` prevents a window from spawning while the "
"project is exporting."
msgstr ""
"Het is **vereist** om het opdrachtargument ``--headless`` te gebruiken op "
"platforms zonder toegang tot een GPU (zoals bij continuous integration). Op "
"platforms met toegang tot een GPU zorgt ``--headless`` ervoor dat er geen "
"venster wordt geopend terwijl het project exporteert."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:473
msgid ""
"The preset name must match the name of an export preset defined in the "
"project's ``export_presets.cfg`` file. If the preset name contains spaces or "
"special characters (such as \"Windows Desktop\"), it must be surrounded with "
"quotes."
msgstr ""
"De naam van de voorinstelling moet overeen komen met de naam van een "
"voorinstelling voor exporteren, gedefinieerd in het ``export_presets.cfg``-"
"bestand van het project. Als de naam van de voorinstelling spaties of "
"speciale tekens bevat (zoals \"Windows Desktop\"), moeten er "
"aanhalingstekens omheen staan."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:477
msgid ""
"To export a debug version of the game, use the ``--export-debug`` switch "
"instead of ``--export-release``. Their parameters and usage are the same."
msgstr ""
"Om een debug-versie van de game te exporteren, kun je de ``--export-debug``-"
"schakel gebruiken in plaats van ``--export-release``. De parameters en het "
"gebruik ervan zijn hetzelfde."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:480
msgid ""
"To export only a PCK file, use the ``--export-pack`` option followed by the "
"preset name and output path, with the file extension, instead of ``--export-"
"release`` or ``--export-debug``. The output path extension determines the "
"package's format, either PCK or ZIP."
msgstr ""
"Om alleen een PCK-bestand te exporteren, kun je de optie ``--export-pack``, "
"gevolgd door de naam van de voorinstelling en het uitvoerpad, met de "
"bestandsextensie, in plaats van ``--export-release`` of ``--export-debug``. "
"De extensie van het uitvoerpad bepaalt het type bestand, PCK danwel ZIP."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:487
msgid ""
"When specifying a relative path as the path for ``--export-release``, ``--"
"export-debug`` or ``--export-pack``, the path will be relative to the "
"directory containing the ``project.godot`` file, **not** relative to the "
"current working directory."
msgstr ""
"Als je een relatief pad opgeeft als pad voor ``--export-release``, ``--"
"export-debug`` of ``--export-pack``, moet het pad relatief zijn ten opzichte "
"van de map waarin het ``project.godot``-bestand staat, **niet** relatief ten "
"opzichte van je huidige map."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:492
msgid "Running a script"
msgstr "Een script uitvoeren"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:494
msgid ""
"It is possible to run a ``.gd`` script from the command line. This feature "
"is especially useful in large projects, e.g. for batch conversion of assets "
"or custom import/export."
msgstr ""
"Het is mogelijk om een ``.gd``-script uit te voeren via de opdrachtprompt. "
"Deze functionaliteit is vooral handig in grote projecten, bijv. om een hoop "
"assets in één keer te converteren, of aangepaste import/export."

