#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/external_editor.rst:100
msgid "LSP/DAP support"
msgstr "LSP/DAP-ondersteuning"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/external_editor.rst:104
msgid ""
"Godot supports the `Language Server Protocol <https://microsoft.github.io/"
"language-server-protocol/>`_ (**LSP**) for code completion and the `Debug "
"Adapter Protocol <https://microsoft.github.io/debug-adapter-protocol/>`_ "
"(**DAP**) for debugging. You can check the `LSP client list <https://"
"microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/implementors/tools/>`_ and `DAP "
"client list <https://microsoft.github.io/debug-adapter-protocol/implementors/"
"tools/>`_ to find if your editor supports them. If this is the case, you "
"should be able to take advantage of these features without the need of a "
"custom plugin."
msgstr ""
"Godot ondersteunt het `Language Server Protocol <https://microsoft.github.io/"
"language-server-protocol/>`_ (**LSP**) voor code-aanvulling en het `Debug "
"Adapter Protocol <https://microsoft.github.io/debug-adapter-protocol/>`_ "
"(**DAP**) voor foutopsporing. Je kunt de `lijst van LSP clients <https://"
"microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/implementors/tools/>`_ en "
"`lijst van DAP clients <https://microsoft.github.io/debug-adapter-protocol/"
"implementors/tools/>`_ bekijken om te zien of je editor deze ondersteunt. Zo "
"ja, dan zou je deze functionaliteiten moeten kunnen gebruiken zonder een "
"speciale plug-in."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/external_editor.rst:108
msgid ""
"To use these protocols, a Godot instance must be running on your current "
"project. You should then configure your editor to communicate to the running "
"adapter ports in Godot, which by default are ``6005`` for **LSP**, and "
"``6006`` for **DAP**. You can change these ports and other settings in the "
"**Editor Settings**, under the **Network > Language Server** and **Network > "
"Debug Adapter** sections respectively."
msgstr ""
"Om deze protocollen te gebruiken, moet een Godot-instantie draaien op je "
"huidige project. Je zou dan je editor moeten kunnen configureren om te "
"communiceren met de draaiende adapterpoorten in Godot. Standaard zijn dit "
"``6005`` voor **LSP** en ``6006`` voor **DAP**. Je kunt deze poorten en "
"andere instellingen aanpassen in de **Editorinstellingen** onder "
"respectievelijk de secties **Netwerk > Taalserver** en **Netwerk > Debug-"
"adapter**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/external_editor.rst:110
msgid "Below are some configuration steps for specific editors:"
msgstr "Hieronder zijn enkele configuratiestappen voor specifieke editors:"

