#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:203
msgid "**SubViewportContainer**"
msgstr "**SubViewportContainer**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:204
msgid ""
"When input events should reach SubViewports and their children, "
"``SubViewportContainer.mouse_filter`` now needs to be ``MOUSE_FILTER_STOP`` "
"or ``MOUSE_FILTER_PASS``. See `GH-79271`_ for details."
msgstr ""
"Als invoergebeurtenissen SubViewports en de kinderen daarvan moeten "
"bereiken, moet nu ``SubViewportContainer.mouse_filter`` worden ingesteld op "
"``MOUSE_FILTER_STOP`` of ``MOUSE_FILTER_PASS``. Zie `GH-79271`_ voor details."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:204
#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:205
msgid "`GH-57894`_"
msgstr "`GH-57894`_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:205
msgid ""
"Multiple layered ``SubViewportContainer`` nodes, that should all receive "
"mouse input events, now need to be replaced by ``Area2D`` nodes. See "
"`GH-79128`_ for details."
msgstr ""
"``SubViewportContainer``-knopen met meerdere lagen, die alle "
"muisinvoergebeurtenissen moeten ontvangen, moeten nu worden vervangen door "
"``Area2D``-knopen. Zie `GH-79128`_ voor details."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:206
msgid "**Viewport**"
msgstr "**Viewport**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.1.rst:207
msgid ""
"``Viewport`` nodes, that have Physics Picking enabled, now automatically set "
"InputEvents as handled. See `GH-79897`_ for workarounds."
msgstr ""
"``Viewport``-knopen waarbij Physics Picking is ingeschakeld, stellen nu "
"automatisch InputEvents in als afgehandeld. Zie `GH-79897`_ voor omzeilingen."

