#: ../../docs/tutorials/inputs/inputevent.rst:143
msgid ""
"Use a :ref:`SubViewportContainer <class_SubViewportContainer>`, which "
"automatically sends events to its child :ref:`SubViewports "
"<class_SubViewport>` after :ref:`Node._input() "
