#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/scene_tree.rst:90
msgid "Scene tree"
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/performance/thread_safe_apis.rst:30
msgid ""
"Interacting with the active scene tree is **not** thread-safe. Make sure to "
"use mutexes when sending data between threads. If you want to call functions "
"or set properties from a thread, you may use :ref:`call_deferred "
"<class_Object_method_call_deferred>` or :ref:`set_deferred "
"<class_Object_method_set_deferred>`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/performance/thread_safe_apis.rst:50
msgid ""
