"<class_ProjectSettings_property_debug/shapes/collision/draw_2d_outlines>` is "
"enabled (which is the default), a solid outline will be derived from the "
"debug color, even if the debug color has full transparency. You can use this "
"to have outline-only debug shapes. This is useful when multiple collision "
"shapes overlap in the same scene, such as a physics collider, a hitbox, and "
"an interaction shape. For example, use ``Color(1, 0, 0, 0)`` for a red "
"outline."
