msgid ""
"Godot currently uses **C# version 14.0** in its engine and example source "
"code, as this is the version supported by .NET 10.0 (the current baseline "
"requirement). So, before we move to a newer version, care must be taken to "
"avoid mixing language features only available in C# 15.0 or later."
