#: ../../docs/tutorials/ui/gui_using_fonts.rst:274
msgid ""
"Antialiasing cannot be changed on :ref:`MSDF-rendered fonts "
"<doc_using_fonts_msdf>` – these are always rendered with grayscale "
"antialiasing."
