#: ../../docs/tutorials/xr/setting_up_xr.rst:39
msgid ""
"Godot has 3 renderer options for projects: Compatibility, Mobile, and "
"Forward+. The current recommendation is to use the Mobile renderer for any "
"desktop VR project, or any project running on a standalone headset like the "
"Meta Quest 3. XR projects will run with the Forward+ renderer, but it isn't "
"well optimized for XR right now compared to the other two."
